  "full_text": "So most people have a, I guess, supposedly they have a mask that blocks what they're thinking. I'm kind of like a strange animal. I haven't socialized, never really was very social, and I've been tortured. And then there's like angels that read your mind and shit, and so like... My mom's talking in the other room. I don't really know how that connects to the current reality right here. That's an example. So, like, there's an angel making her talk, and it's, like, interacting over here. It's all fucked up. So, like, Terry's asking himself. Terry's, like, really excited. Hey, we're making all kinds of plans. partying with Prince Harry, and he's like going, dude, it's probably kind of like homo, you know? Like, why are you getting excited about, like, a friend? It's like, I think spending, like, obsessing about, it's like, no, that's not really clear. But, like, I haven't had any friends or anything. And so, like, going, dude, man, like, there's, like, homo. interactions and shit, you know, like the homo salute or some shit. She's like, Terry's gonna do it, man. This is fucked up. It's like, I think the military got all that figured out. So, yeah, I'm kind of like, I've been like tortured by angels, mind raping and everything. It's like, imagine your mind is like totally open and shit, you know, and it's like. You know, at first it's really bad, but after a while you're like a fucking twitching animal and shit.",
